    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      400.93,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the TelecommunicationLevy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013, and shall bedeemed for all purposes to have come into operation onJanuary 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      368.45,
      400.94,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Telecommunication Levy Act,No. 21 of 2011 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords and figures \u201c for the period commencing on or afterJanuary 1, 2011 a levy called Telecommunication Levy atthe rate of 20 per centum on the value of the supply oftelecommunication services provided by the operator, onthe receipt of such telecommunication service in respect ofeach month:\u201d of the words and figures ,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      495.53,
      359.15,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c a levy called Telecommunication Levy :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
